=[ tomet-markdown ]

Bidirectional conversion between CommonMark and `tomet_ast`.

==[ Overview ]

Handles conversion between CommonMark Markdown and the Tomet Abstract Syntax Tree
([`tomet_ast::Document`]), supporting frontmatter, wikilinks, tables, callouts,
and standard markup.

==[ Key Functions ]

- `from_markdown` CommonMark text into a Tomet [`tomet_ast::Document`].:Parses
- `from_markdown_with_options` CommonMark text using custom [`ImportOptions`].:Parses
- `to_markdown` a Tomet [`tomet_ast::Document`] into clean CommonMark text.:Converts

==[ Key Types ]

- `ImportOptions` controlling frontmatter and extension parsing.:Options

Known-lossy cases are documented where they are implemented: `import`'s module
doc for Markdown -> Tomet, `export`'s for the other direction.
